sequenceDiagram
  participant Stripe
  participant Edge as Webhook Worker
  participant DB as PostgreSQL inbox
  participant Queue
  participant Handler

  Stripe->>Edge: Raw body, Stripe-Signature
  Edge->>Edge: Verify signature and environment
  alt Invalid
    Edge-->>Stripe: 400
  else Valid
    Edge->>DB: Insert provider plus event ID
    DB-->>Edge: New or duplicate receipt
    Edge-->>Stripe: 200 quickly
    Edge->>Queue: Enqueue inbox ID
    Queue->>Handler: At-least-once delivery
    Handler->>DB: Claim inbox and check consumer key
    Handler->>Stripe: Retrieve current object if ordering is unsafe
    Handler->>DB: Apply effect, audit, outbox, mark processed
  end
